{"seq":3,"slug":"filesystem-automation","title":"文件系统自动化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/personal-automation/system-level-automation/filesystem-automation","wordCount":1021,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"文件系统自动化\">文件系统自动化</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>文件系统是操作系统中最基础也最被忽视的自动化领域。每天你在 Downloads 文件夹里堆积的文件、散落在桌面的截图、需要按日期归档的文档——这些重复性的文件整理工作消耗着大量的微决策能量。文件系统自动化的目标是让文件&quot;自己找到正确的位置&quot;。</p>\n<p>macOS 提供了从简单到复杂的完整文件自动化工具链：Hazel 的规则引擎适合非技术用户、launchd 定时任务适合系统级调度、FSEvents 文件监控适合需要实时响应的场景、Apple Shortcuts 的文件夹触发器则是 2026 年最新的系统原生方案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"文件自动化模式分类\">文件自动化模式分类</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>触发方式</th>\n<th>延迟</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>事件驱动</td>\n<td>文件系统事件（创建/修改/删除）</td>\n<td>实时</td>\n<td>下载完成即分类</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>轮询驱动</td>\n<td>定时检查目录状态</td>\n<td>周期性</td>\n<td>每小时清理临时文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>手动触发</td>\n<td>用户启动脚本</td>\n<td>即时</td>\n<td>批量重命名/整理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>条件驱动</td>\n<td>文件属性匹配规则</td>\n<td>实时</td>\n<td>大于 100MB 的文件移动到外置硬盘</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"文件分类决策树\">文件分类决策树</h3><p>设计文件自动路由时，需要考虑的属性维度：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"文件到达&#10;├── 按扩展名分类&#10;│   ├── .pdf → Documents/PDFs/&#10;│   ├── .png/.jpg → Pictures/&#10;│   └── .zip/.tar → Archives/&#10;├── 按来源分类&#10;│   ├── Safari 下载 → Downloads/Web/&#10;│   ├── AirDrop 接收 → Downloads/AirDrop/&#10;│   └── 邮件附件 → Downloads/Mail/&#10;├── 按大小分类&#10;│   ├── &gt; 1GB → 外置硬盘&#10;│   └── &lt; 1GB → 本地存储&#10;├── 按日期分类&#10;│   └── 按年/月归档 → Archive/2026/05/&#10;└── 按内容分类（AI）&#10;    ├── 发票 → Finance/Invoices/&#10;    ├── 合同 → Legal/Contracts/&#10;    └── 简历 → HR/Resumes/\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>文件到达</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── 按扩展名分类</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── .pdf → Documents/PDFs/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── .png/.jpg → Pictures/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── .zip/.tar → Archives/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── 按来源分类</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── Safari 下载 → Downloads/Web/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── AirDrop 接收 → Downloads/AirDrop/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── 邮件附件 → Downloads/Mail/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── 按大小分类</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── > 1GB → 外置硬盘</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── &#x3C; 1GB → 本地存储</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── 按日期分类</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── 按年/月归档 → Archive/2026/05/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── 按内容分类（AI）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ├── 发票 → Finance/Invoices/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ├── 合同 → Legal/Contracts/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    └── 简历 → HR/Resumes/</span></span></code></pre></div><p>同一份决策逻辑用流程图表示：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    F[&quot;文件到达&quot;] --&gt; Q1{按什么维度分类?}&#10;    Q1 --&gt;|扩展名| E1[&quot;pdf → Documents/PDFs/&quot;]&#10;    Q1 --&gt;|扩展名| E2[&quot;png/jpg → Pictures/&quot;]&#10;    Q1 --&gt;|大小| S1[&quot;大于 1GB → 外置硬盘&quot;]&#10;    Q1 --&gt;|来源| O1[&quot;Safari → Downloads/Web/&quot;]&#10;    Q1 --&gt;|内容 AI| C1[&quot;发票 → Finance/Invoices/&quot;]\">graph TD\n    F[\"文件到达\"] --&gt; Q1{按什么维度分类?}\n    Q1 --&gt;|扩展名| E1[\"pdf → Documents/PDFs/\"]\n    Q1 --&gt;|扩展名| E2[\"png/jpg → Pictures/\"]\n    Q1 --&gt;|大小| S1[\"大于 1GB → 外置硬盘\"]\n    Q1 --&gt;|来源| O1[\"Safari → Downloads/Web/\"]\n    Q1 --&gt;|内容 AI| C1[\"发票 → Finance/Invoices/\"]</pre><h3 id=\"macos-文件系统事件机制\">macOS 文件系统事件机制</h3><p>macOS 通过 FSEvents API 提供文件系统变更通知：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"内核层: kqueue / FSEvents&#10;    ↓&#10;系统服务: fseventsd&#10;    ↓&#10;用户空间 API:&#10;├── FSEventStream (高层 API, 目录级别)&#10;├── kqueue (低层 API, 文件级别)&#10;├── DispatchSource.makeFileSystemObjectSource (Swift)&#10;└── NSFileCoordinator (跨进程协调)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>内核层: kqueue / FSEvents</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>系统服务: fseventsd</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>用户空间 API:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── FSEventStream (高层 API, 目录级别)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── kqueue (低层 API, 文件级别)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── DispatchSource.makeFileSystemObjectSource (Swift)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── NSFileCoordinator (跨进程协调)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"实战指南\">实战指南</h2><h3 id=\"hazel-规则引擎配置\">Hazel 规则引擎配置</h3><p>Hazel 是 macOS 上最流行的规则驱动文件管理器，通过条件匹配自动执行操作：</p>\n<p><strong>规则 1：Downloads 文件夹自动分类</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Folder: ~/Downloads&#10;&#10;Rule: &quot;Sort PDFs&quot;&#10;  Conditions: Extension is pdf&#10;  Actions:&#10;    1. Move to ~/Documents/PDFs/&#10;    2. Add color label: Blue&#10;&#10;Rule: &quot;Sort Images&quot;&#10;  Conditions: Kind is Image&#10;  Actions:&#10;    1. Move to ~/Pictures/Screenshots/ (if name starts with &quot;Screenshot&quot;)&#10;    2. Move to ~/Pictures/Downloads/ (otherwise)&#10;&#10;Rule: &quot;Archive Old Files&quot;&#10;  Conditions:&#10;    - Date Added is not in the last 7 days&#10;    - Kind is not Folder&#10;  Actions:&#10;    1. Move to ~/Archive/{Year}/{Month}/&#10;    2. Display notification &quot;Archived: {name}&quot;&#10;&#10;Rule: &quot;Large File Alert&quot;&#10;  Conditions: Size is greater than 500 MB&#10;  Actions:&#10;    1. Display notification &quot;Large file: {name} ({size})&quot;&#10;    2. Add tag: &quot;review-size&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Folder: ~/Downloads</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Rule: \"Sort PDFs\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Conditions: Extension is pdf</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Actions:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    1. Move to ~/Documents/PDFs/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    2. Add color label: Blue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Rule: \"Sort Images\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Conditions: Kind is Image</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Actions:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    1. Move to ~/Pictures/Screenshots/ (if name starts with \"Screenshot\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    2. Move to ~/Pictures/Downloads/ (otherwise)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Rule: \"Archive Old Files\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Conditions:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    - Date Added is not in the last 7 days</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    - Kind is not Folder</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Actions:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    1. Move to ~/Archive/{Year}/{Month}/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    2. Display notification \"Archived: {name}\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Rule: \"Large File Alert\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Conditions: Size is greater than 500 MB</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Actions:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    1. Display notification \"Large file: {name} ({size})\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    2. Add tag: \"review-size\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>规则 2：桌面零收件箱</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Folder: ~/Desktop&#10;&#10;Rule: &quot;Clear Desktop Daily&quot;&#10;  Conditions:&#10;    - Date Added is not today&#10;    - Kind is not Folder&#10;    - Name does not contain &quot;keep&quot;&#10;  Actions:&#10;    1. Move to ~/Desktop/Archive/{Date Added}/{name}&#10;    2. If folder ~/Desktop/Archive/{Date Added} is new&#10;       → Sort by Kind\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Folder: ~/Desktop</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Rule: \"Clear Desktop Daily\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Conditions:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    - Date Added is not today</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    - Kind is not Folder</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    - Name does not contain \"keep\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Actions:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    1. Move to ~/Desktop/Archive/{Date Added}/{name}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    2. If folder ~/Desktop/Archive/{Date Added} is new</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>       → Sort by Kind</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"launchd-定时任务\">launchd 定时任务</h3><p>macOS 的 cron 替代品，支持精细的调度和条件触发：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"xml\" data-code=\"&lt;?xml version=&quot;1.0&quot; encoding=&quot;UTF-8&quot;?&gt;&#10;&lt;!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC &quot;-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN&quot;&#10;  &quot;http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd&quot;&gt;&#10;&lt;plist version=&quot;1.0&quot;&gt;&#10;&lt;dict&gt;&#10;    &lt;key&gt;Label&lt;/key&gt;&#10;    &lt;string&gt;com.user.cleanup-downloads&lt;/string&gt;&#10;    &lt;key&gt;ProgramArguments&lt;/key&gt;&#10;    &lt;array&gt;&#10;        &lt;string&gt;/bin/bash&lt;/string&gt;&#10;        &lt;string&gt;/Users/you/scripts/cleanup-downloads.sh&lt;/string&gt;&#10;    &lt;/array&gt;&#10;    &lt;key&gt;StartCalendarInterval&lt;/key&gt;&#10;    &lt;dict&gt;&#10;        &lt;key&gt;Hour&lt;/key&gt;&#10;        &lt;integer&gt;2&lt;/integer&gt;&#10;        &lt;key&gt;Minute&lt;/key&gt;&#10;        &lt;integer&gt;0&lt;/integer&gt;&#10;    &lt;/dict&gt;&#10;    &lt;key&gt;StandardOutPath&lt;/key&gt;&#10;    &lt;string&gt;/tmp/cleanup-downloads.log&lt;/string&gt;&#10;    &lt;key&gt;StandardErrorPath&lt;/key&gt;&#10;    &lt;string&gt;/tmp/cleanup-downloads.err&lt;/string&gt;&#10;&lt;/dict&gt;&#10;&lt;/plist&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;?</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">xml</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> encoding</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"UTF-8\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">?></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;!</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DOCTYPE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> plist</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> PUBLIC \"-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  \"http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">plist</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">dict</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>Label&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>com.user.cleanup-downloads&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>ProgramArguments&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">   