n><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$event</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ~/Downloads/Archives/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      ;;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  esac</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">done</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"apple-shortcuts-文件夹触发器-macos-26\">Apple Shortcuts 文件夹触发器（macOS 26）</h3><p>最新的原生方案，无需第三方工具：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Automation Trigger: Folder (~/Downloads, when files are added)&#10;&#10;1. Get [Shortcut Input]&#10;2. Get Details of [file]: File Extension&#10;3. If [extension] is &quot;pdf&quot;&#10;   → Move [file] to ~/Documents/PDFs/&#10;4. Otherwise If [extension] is any of [&quot;png&quot;, &quot;jpg&quot;, &quot;heic&quot;]&#10;   → If [file size] &gt; 5 MB&#10;     → Move to ~/Pictures/Large/&#10;   → Otherwise&#10;     → Move to ~/Pictures/Downloads/&#10;5. Otherwise If [file size] &gt; 500 MB&#10;   → Show Alert &quot;Large file downloaded: [name]&quot;&#10;   → Move to ~/Downloads/Large/&#10;6. Show Notification &quot;Sorted: [name]&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Automation Trigger: Folder (~/Downloads, when files are added)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>1. Get [Shortcut Input]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>2. Get Details of [file]: File Extension</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>3. If [extension] is \"pdf\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>   → Move [file] to ~/Documents/PDFs/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>4. Otherwise If [extension] is any of [\"png\", \"jpg\", \"heic\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>   → If [file size] > 5 MB</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     → Move to ~/Pictures/Large/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>   → Otherwise</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     → Move to ~/Pictures/Downloads/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>5. Otherwise If [file size] > 500 MB</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>   → Show Alert \"Large file downloaded: [name]\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>   → Move to ~/Downloads/Large/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>6. Show Notification \"Sorted: [name]\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h2><h3 id=\"文件命名规范\">文件命名规范</h3><p>自动化的前提是可预测的命名。建立命名规范：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"标准格式: YYYY-MM-DD_category_description.ext&#10;&#10;示例:&#10;  2026-05-08_invoice_aws-monthly.pdf&#10;  2026-05-08_receipt_coffee-shop.jpg&#10;  2026-05-08_screenshot_bug-report.png\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>标准格式: YYYY-MM-DD_category_description.ext</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>示例:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  2026-05-08_invoice_aws-monthly.pdf</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  2026-05-08_receipt_coffee-shop.jpg</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  2026-05-08_screenshot_bug-report.png</span></span></code></pre></div><p>批量重命名脚本：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"#!/bin/bash&#10;# 将无规律文件名转换为标准格式&#10;for file in ~/Downloads/*.pdf; do&#10;  date=$(stat -f &quot;%Sm&quot; -t &quot;%Y-%m-%d&quot; &quot;$file&quot;)&#10;  newname=&quot;${date}_unsorted_$(basename &quot;$file&quot;)&quot;&#10;  mv &quot;$file&quot; ~/Documents/Inbox/&quot;$newname&quot;&#10;done\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#!/bin/bash</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 将无规律文件名转换为标准格式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> file </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ~/Downloads/*.pdf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">do</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">stat</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"%Sm\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -t</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"%Y-%m-%d\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$file</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  newname</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">date</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}_unsorted_$(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">basename</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$file</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\")\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  mv</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$file</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ~/Documents/Inbox/\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$newname</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">done</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"防误操作设计\">防误操作设计</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>预览模式</strong>：先 <code>echo</code> 操作而非直接执行，确认无误后再 <code>mv</code></li>\n<li><strong>回收站机制</strong>：移动到 <code>.trash/</code> 而非直接删除，保留 30 天</li>\n<li><strong>排除规则</strong>：永远不触碰 <code>.git</code>、<code>node_modules</code>、<code>.env</code> 文件</li>\n<li><strong>文件锁检测</strong>：处理前检查文件是否被占用（<code>lsof</code>）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"性能考量\">性能考量</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>避免监控整个 home 目录</strong>：限定到具体文件夹</li>\n<li><strong>防抖处理</strong>：大文件下载过程中会产生大量 FSEvents，等待文件写入完成</li>\n<li><strong>资源限制</strong>：设置最大并行处理数，避免 CPU 尖峰</li>\n<li><strong>日志轮转</strong>：定期清理自动化产生的日志文件</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"工具与生态\">工具与生态</h2><h3 id=\"macos-文件自动化工具栈\">macOS 文件自动化工具栈</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>价格</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Hazel</td>\n<td>规则引擎</td>\n<td>最易用，条件丰富</td>\n<td>$42</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Apple Shortcuts</td>\n<td>系统原生</td>\n<td>免费，跨设备</td>\n<td>免费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>fswatch</td>\n<td>CLI 监控</td>\n<td>轻量，脚本友好</td>\n<td>免费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>launchd</td>\n<td>系统调度</td>\n<td>系统原生，可靠</td>\n<td>免费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Automator</td>\n<td>已弃用</td>\n<td>被 Shortcuts 取代</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"云同步与文件自动化\">云同步与文件自动化</h3><p>注意文件自动化与云同步的交互：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>iCloud Drive</strong>：移动文件可能触发大量同步</li>\n<li><strong>Dropbox</strong>：Smart Sync 的&quot;仅在线&quot;文件不能被本地脚本处理</li>\n<li><strong>策略</strong>：自动化规则应排除云同步的占位符文件</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"监控与告警\">监控与告警</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 简单的健康检查：确保自动化仍在运行&#10;if ! pgrep -f &quot;watch-downloads.sh&quot; &gt; /dev/null; then&#10;  osascript -e &#39;display notification &quot;File watcher stopped!&quot; with title &quot;Automation Alert&quot;&#39;&#10;  # 自动重启&#10;  nohup ~/scripts/watch-downloads.sh &amp;&#10;fi\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 简单的健康检查：确保自动化仍在运行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> pgrep</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"watch-downloads.sh\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /dev/null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  osascript</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -e</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'display notification \"File watcher stopped!\" with title \"Automation Alert\"'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 自动重启</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  nohup</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ~/scripts/watch-downloads.sh</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x26;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">fi</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"总结\">总结</h2><p>文件系统自动化是&quot;set and forget&quot;型自动化的最佳代表——一次配置，长期受益。核心原则：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Hazel 是大多数用户的最佳起点——规则引擎强大且零代码</li>\n<li>macOS 26 的 Shortcuts 文件夹触发器是免费的原生替代</li>\n<li>建立文件命名规范是自动化的前提条件</li>\n<li>防误操作设计（预览模式 + 回收站）是必须的安全网</li>\n<li>不要监控过大的目录范围——精准定位到具体文件夹</li>\n<li>launchd 比 cron 更适合 macOS——它理解系统睡眠/唤醒状态</li>\n</ol>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"文件系统自动化","id":"文件系统自动化"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"文件自动化模式分类","id":"文件自动化模式分类"},{"level":3,"text":"文件分类决策树","id":"文件分类决策树"},{"level":3,"text":"macOS 文件系统事件机制","id":"macos-文件系统事件机制"},{"level":2,"text":"实战指南","id":"实战指南"},{"level":3,"text":"Hazel 规则引擎配置","id":"hazel-规则引擎配置"},{"level":3,"text":"launchd 定时任务","id":"launchd-定时任务"},{"level":3,"text":"FSEvents 实时监控脚本","id":"fsevents-实时监控脚本"},{"level":3,"text":"Apple Shortcuts 文件夹触发器（macOS 26）","id":"apple-shortcuts-文件夹触发器-macos-26"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":3,"text":"文件命名规范","id":"文件命名规范"},{"level":3,"text":"防误操作设计","id":"防误操作设计"},{"level":3,"text":"性能考量","id":"性能考量"},{"level":2,"text":"工具与生态","id":"工具与生态"},{"level":3,"text":"macOS 文件自动化工具栈","id":"macos-文件自动化工具栈"},{"level":3,"text":"云同步与文件自动化","id":"云同步与文件自动化"},{"level":3,"text":"监控与告警","id":"监控与告警"},{"level":2,"text":"总结","id":"总结"}],"prev":{"title":"Hammerspoon 与 Keyboard Maestro","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/personal-automation/system-level-automation/hammerspoon-keyboard-maestro"},"next":{"title":"ROI 评估框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/personal-automation/automation-philosophy/roi-evaluation-framework"}}